<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1"/>
  <title>Install ${APP_NAME}</title>
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
         background:#FFF8EF;color:#3D1F08;min-height:100vh;
         display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}
    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:36px 28px;
          max-width:420px;width:100%;
          box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(232,137,43,.18)}
    .paw{font-size:52px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:12px}
    h1{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;text-align:center;
       background:linear-gradient(90deg,#F4A853,#E8892B);
       -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
    .subtitle{text-align:center;color:#96705A;font-size:14px;margin:6px 0 28px}
    .btn{display:block;width:100%;padding:17px;border-radius:16px;
         background:linear-gradient(90deg,#F4A853,#E8892B,#C4701A);
         color:#fff;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;
         text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:28px;
         box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(232,137,43,.40)}
    .btn:active{opacity:.85}
    .steps{background:#FFF1E0;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:20px}
    .steps p{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#E8892B;margin-bottom:10px}
    .steps ol{padding-left:18px}
    .steps li{font-size:13px;color:#3D1F08;margin-bottom:7px;line-height:1.5}
    .steps li strong{color:#C4701A}
    .meta{text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#96705A;line-height:1.7}
    .warning{background:#FFF1E0;border-left:4px solid #E8892B;border-radius:8px;
             padding:12px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#92400E;margin-top:16px;line-height:1.6}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="paw">🐾</div>
    <h1>${APP_NAME}</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Find your perfect dog breed &nbsp;·&nbsp; ${RELEASE_TAG}</p>

    <a class="btn"
       href="itms-services://?action=download-manifest&amp;url=${MANIFEST_URL}">
      ⬇&nbsp;&nbsp;Install on iPhone / iPad
    </a>

    <div class="steps">
      <p>📋 Before you install</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Your device <strong>UDID must be registered</strong> in the Ad&nbsp;Hoc provisioning profile.</li>
        <li>Tap the button above <strong>in Safari</strong> (other browsers won't work).</li>
        <li>After install go to <strong>Settings → General → VPN &amp; Device Management</strong> and trust the developer certificate.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <p class="meta">
      ${BUNDLE_ID}<br>
      Built from <a href="https://github.com/${REPO}/releases/tag/${RELEASE_TAG}"
        style="color:#E8892B">${RELEASE_TAG}</a>
    </p>

    <div class="warning">
      ⚠️ This is a <strong>Development</strong> build — not from the App Store.
      Open this page in <strong>Safari</strong> on your iOS device.
      Your device must be registered in the Apple Developer Portal.
      The button will not work on a Mac or in other browsers.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
